WEBVTT

00:34.951 --> 00:36.119
What's your name?

00:43.835 --> 00:45.503
What's your actual name?

01:04.606 --> 01:05.899
Send my message.

01:40.725 --> 01:42.102
I don't need you.

01:45.563 --> 01:47.190
I'm not here to help you.

01:51.194 --> 01:53.488
Mr. Choi asked me to give you a message.

01:57.158 --> 01:59.452
You won't end up in prison, I promise.

02:03.581 --> 02:04.749
Come back to me.

02:15.135 --> 02:16.427
You were hurt.

02:23.393 --> 02:25.228
My client needs medical help.

02:25.311 --> 02:26.271
What?

02:27.397 --> 02:29.941
Our captain is still in a coma, lady.

02:30.525 --> 02:32.360
Should I submit
a formal complaint?

02:32.443 --> 02:34.779
I'd worry about yourself first before her.

02:35.530 --> 02:37.198
You should cut your losses.

02:38.783 --> 02:42.245
Bring me documents on Dongcheon,
and we'll request mitigation.

02:42.328 --> 02:45.373
The reporters seem to be curious
about what happened.

02:46.958 --> 02:50.753
If we say there was
a Dongcheon mole in Narcotics,

02:51.588 --> 02:52.881
that would be news.

03:35.715 --> 03:36.716
Hey.

03:38.551 --> 03:40.220
She left for the hospital.

03:45.934 --> 03:46.935
Bring her to me.

03:48.102 --> 03:49.312
Yes, sir.

04:46.536 --> 04:53.418
WARD 15

04:58.256 --> 04:59.257
Captain?

05:00.091 --> 05:01.134
Pildo.

05:04.262 --> 05:06.055
I'm at the hospital. I'll come over.

05:06.848 --> 05:08.641
- Is he awake?
- Yes.

05:08.725 --> 05:09.726
- I'll be right back.
- Yeah.

05:09.809 --> 05:10.810
Wait here. Okay.

05:19.485 --> 05:20.486
This will hurt.

05:20.570 --> 05:21.529
Stay calm.

05:22.655 --> 05:23.573
Cut.

05:25.408 --> 05:26.451
Mm.

05:29.912 --> 05:31.497
- Help me.
- Mm.

05:52.477 --> 05:53.811
Can you cut this?

05:54.520 --> 05:55.521
Yes.

05:58.066 --> 05:59.067
Mm.

06:01.652 --> 06:02.987
Get me the dressing band.

06:03.571 --> 06:05.740
Um… Band.

06:06.324 --> 06:08.159
- Sorry. I'll go get it.
- Right.

06:20.421 --> 06:22.298
I'm looking for the band.

06:29.055 --> 06:31.057
Yes? Oh, professor.

06:31.140 --> 06:33.309
Oh, I checked on him
this morning.

06:33.393 --> 06:35.436
He didn't look well earlier today.

06:35.520 --> 06:37.146
He was very septic.

06:37.230 --> 06:38.398
He had a high fever,

06:38.481 --> 06:41.484
and his CRP level
was between five and ten.

06:41.567 --> 06:43.945
Yes. So we got a CT scan.

06:44.028 --> 06:46.364
I took a look at it,
and that looked very bad too.

06:46.447 --> 06:48.199
You said it could be endocytosis.

06:48.282 --> 06:51.494
I thought it may be better
to just operate instead.

06:51.577 --> 06:54.705
So I scheduled him
for a surgery this afternoon.

06:55.748 --> 06:56.791
Captain.

06:57.750 --> 06:58.835
Are you all right?

06:59.794 --> 07:01.671
Hey.

07:02.505 --> 07:04.006
I almost died.

07:05.550 --> 07:07.718
- Well, do you want some water?
- No, I don't.

07:11.722 --> 07:13.015
Detective Oh…

07:13.099 --> 07:14.976
We caught her.

07:15.059 --> 07:16.644
She did it. She stabbed you.

07:16.727 --> 07:18.563
- She's in the hospital--
- Pildo.

07:20.231 --> 07:21.649
Yeah?

07:28.030 --> 07:29.157
You know…

07:31.075 --> 07:32.910
Yoon Donghoon, right?

07:33.578 --> 07:35.329
Yoon Donghoon of Dongcheon

07:35.413 --> 07:37.623
who was killed five years ago?

07:37.707 --> 07:38.749
Ah, yes.

07:39.375 --> 07:40.501
She is…

07:41.961 --> 07:44.505
…Yoon Donghoon's daughter.

07:59.103 --> 08:02.231
Yoon Donghoon's real name was Song Joonsu.

08:04.567 --> 08:05.526
I…

08:06.611 --> 08:09.614
Wait, the late Narcotics detective?

08:13.117 --> 08:14.577
He was undercover.

08:17.413 --> 08:19.499
I sent him into Dongcheon.

08:24.795 --> 08:27.673
I think our best option
is to get him in surgery today

08:27.757 --> 08:30.343
which is why I schedule him
for this afternoon.

08:31.219 --> 08:32.345
Yes.

08:33.554 --> 08:35.890
You don't need to worry about it.

08:35.973 --> 08:38.809
Yes, well, just in case…

08:38.893 --> 08:40.603
But I am almost done here.

08:40.686 --> 08:42.939
Once I finish, I'll check on him again.

08:43.940 --> 08:45.858
Yes. Yes.

08:50.321 --> 08:52.740
Jung Taeju is the one who stabbed me.

08:54.200 --> 08:56.285
I brought him home last night.

08:56.369 --> 08:59.205
He seemed nervous,
so I offered to stay, but he said no…

09:00.873 --> 09:02.333
It wasn't your fault.

09:05.545 --> 09:06.837
So it was Do Gangjae.

09:07.713 --> 09:09.465
The one you wanted to catch.

09:11.801 --> 09:14.595
You're doing this
because of your dad, right?

09:16.430 --> 09:17.723
Jiwoo…

09:18.724 --> 09:21.852
joined up with her dad's killer
to try and get revenge.

09:25.147 --> 09:27.817
Choi Mujin deceived her.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.863
If I'm honest,

09:34.865 --> 09:36.409
will you believe me?

09:37.827 --> 09:39.036
Pildo.

09:41.664 --> 09:42.915
Thank you.

09:52.133 --> 09:54.218
- Please finish up.
- Right.

09:58.306 --> 10:00.433
- Are you finished?
- Yes. She'll be out shortly.

10:00.516 --> 10:01.517
Yeah.

10:08.649 --> 10:11.319
Take the side door and go down to B2.

10:11.902 --> 10:13.362
My car is there for you.

10:31.589 --> 10:32.715
This is good.

10:33.549 --> 10:34.967
I wanted to punch you.

10:44.477 --> 10:46.062
Argh!

10:57.073 --> 10:57.990
Yeah?

10:58.074 --> 10:59.617
Pildo.

10:59.700 --> 11:01.410
Hyejin got away.

12:19.029 --> 12:20.281
Song Jiwoo!

12:27.496 --> 12:29.206
No. No!

12:29.290 --> 12:30.166
Argh!

12:30.249 --> 12:32.334
Song Jiwoo.

12:32.960 --> 12:34.295
That's your name, right?

12:37.840 --> 12:40.426
What do you plan to do?

12:41.844 --> 12:43.220
Are you going to Choi Mujin?

12:46.140 --> 12:47.767
The Captain told me.

12:47.850 --> 12:49.894
Did you let him go

12:49.977 --> 12:51.270
so you can kill him yourself?

12:53.397 --> 12:55.065
Yeah, so move.

12:58.360 --> 12:59.528
No.

12:59.612 --> 13:00.905
I'll stop you.

13:06.160 --> 13:07.578
No.

13:08.871 --> 13:09.872
Enough already!

13:09.955 --> 13:11.457
No!

13:13.250 --> 13:14.752
You get it now.

13:14.835 --> 13:16.587
You must know why I'm doing this!

13:18.464 --> 13:19.381
I do.

13:21.425 --> 13:22.843
That's why I'm stopping you.

13:23.677 --> 13:25.095
No, you don't know

13:25.679 --> 13:27.306
how I got to this point.

13:29.892 --> 13:33.103
I threw away my future and my name
to catch that asshole!

13:34.772 --> 13:37.191
But he tricked me and I killed someone.

13:38.275 --> 13:40.694
If I don't kill him,
my life has no meaning.

13:48.285 --> 13:50.412
Is this all your life is worth, huh?

13:52.623 --> 13:54.166
Get out of my way.

14:02.007 --> 14:04.760
How can I just let you go
and drive to your death?

14:06.095 --> 14:08.681
Even if you kill him,
you'll be utterly destroyed!

14:08.764 --> 14:10.266
Don't you get it?

14:10.349 --> 14:11.976
I don't care about that.

14:12.935 --> 14:14.103
Well, I do.

14:16.438 --> 14:18.524
Go! Enough!

14:20.609 --> 14:21.610
Let go!

14:43.090 --> 14:44.049
Get in.

14:49.847 --> 14:51.849
Get them! Go after them!

14:53.559 --> 14:54.560
Stop!

15:51.200 --> 15:52.868
Shit.

15:55.079 --> 15:56.205
Hold on tight.

16:30.698 --> 16:31.949
We lost her.

16:32.700 --> 16:34.952
An officer took her and they disappeared.

18:21.517 --> 18:23.393
We got here earlier than we expected.

18:25.854 --> 18:28.148
You remember our beach plans, don't you?

19:12.609 --> 19:15.904
My friend who loves to surf
rent out this place long-term.

19:50.522 --> 19:51.773
Let me see your cut.

19:52.900 --> 19:54.109
No, I'm fine.

19:59.656 --> 20:01.283
Hearing that makes me angry.

20:06.496 --> 20:07.539
Sit down.

20:39.821 --> 20:42.199
I started carrying a knife
after my sister died.

20:45.661 --> 20:47.955
I was determined to kill the bastard

20:49.498 --> 20:50.791
if I found him.

21:05.013 --> 21:06.515
Every night, I dreamt…

21:07.891 --> 21:09.518
about killing the guy.

21:12.729 --> 21:14.189
And eventually,

21:14.898 --> 21:16.233
my face changed.

21:22.531 --> 21:25.742
I look like a murderer consumed with rage.

21:32.040 --> 21:32.958
I…

21:37.713 --> 21:39.381
I was hurting myself.

21:46.138 --> 21:47.889
Don't destroy yourself.

21:53.103 --> 21:54.646
Don't move. Stay still.

22:31.808 --> 22:33.894
Don't struggle alone anymore.

22:36.688 --> 22:38.398
You can lean on me anytime.

25:56.346 --> 25:59.099
Choi Mujin put a tattoo on my chest.

26:03.061 --> 26:04.646
I burned it off.

26:16.658 --> 26:19.327
You and I chose different directions.

26:28.837 --> 26:30.088
Let's catch him…

26:31.631 --> 26:32.716
together.

26:38.430 --> 26:40.140
We'll fulfill your father's wish.

26:41.141 --> 26:43.101
Judging with the law
rather than killing him.

26:48.857 --> 26:51.776
Your father sacrificed his life for this.

26:54.613 --> 26:56.281
And now you can do it.

27:27.687 --> 27:31.733
BOW RESTAURANT

27:32.776 --> 27:33.943
- Taeju!
- Hi.

27:34.027 --> 27:35.987
- Are the boys here yet?
- No, not yet.

27:36.071 --> 27:38.406
Hi. Welcome. Come in.

27:38.490 --> 27:40.700
Hungry for pork belly.

27:42.035 --> 27:42.911
Oh.

27:44.037 --> 27:45.455
- Minjae, I'm sorry.
- Get out of here.

27:45.538 --> 27:47.040
Hey, you.

27:48.208 --> 27:50.460
Go, huh? Go on and study.

27:50.543 --> 27:51.753
Huh?

27:51.836 --> 27:53.088
I wanna join Dongcheon.

27:53.171 --> 27:55.090
- Hey, stop.
- Take your bag.

27:55.173 --> 27:56.883
Hey, what grade are you? Get out of here.

27:56.966 --> 27:58.593
- Let him talk.
- What?

27:59.260 --> 28:00.845
What do you mean? He's a kid.

28:00.929 --> 28:02.222
Why do you wanna join?

28:03.682 --> 28:04.933
Well…

28:05.517 --> 28:07.686
I wanna be cool like you guys.

28:07.769 --> 28:09.396
Seriously?

28:09.479 --> 28:10.605
Are you smart?

28:11.439 --> 28:12.649
Yes, I am.

28:12.732 --> 28:14.984
Hey. Go and study then, okay?

28:15.068 --> 28:16.152
I mean it, Boss.

28:16.236 --> 28:17.821
- You kids watch way too many movies.
- Please accept me.

28:17.904 --> 28:18.738
No, you don't get it.

28:18.822 --> 28:20.323
- I can handle it.
- Hey, come on. Let's go.

28:48.977 --> 28:51.896
Boss. Donghoon is at his place.

29:17.422 --> 29:18.465
Papa!

29:19.466 --> 29:20.383
Papa!

29:27.015 --> 29:28.892
Papa!

29:30.018 --> 29:32.937
Papa!

29:33.021 --> 29:34.898
Jiwoo, don't come out!

29:34.981 --> 29:36.649
Please, don't come out.

29:37.317 --> 29:38.276
Open the door!

29:40.862 --> 29:41.946
I…

29:43.239 --> 29:44.532
never once…

29:47.160 --> 29:49.829
betrayed someone who trusted in me.

29:52.081 --> 29:54.876
So why does everyone keep betraying me?

30:01.716 --> 30:02.842
Right…

30:04.344 --> 30:06.387
She wants to kill me now.

30:09.933 --> 30:11.226
That's why…

30:12.060 --> 30:14.395
That's why…

30:15.897 --> 30:17.482
she should've come here.

30:26.241 --> 30:28.660
Right, Donghoon?

30:29.702 --> 30:31.120
She should've come here.

30:35.041 --> 30:36.709
She should've come to me.

30:38.294 --> 30:40.672
There's a warrant out for you.

30:41.589 --> 30:42.799
You must run away.

30:43.424 --> 30:45.176
They say they have a witness.

30:45.260 --> 30:46.761
It's must be Detective Oh.

30:46.845 --> 30:48.012
You need to run.

30:53.309 --> 30:55.854
You told me she would come to kill you.

30:56.646 --> 30:57.897
Exactly.

30:58.898 --> 31:00.733
She should've come here.

31:03.111 --> 31:04.279
She should've…

31:05.280 --> 31:06.573
come to me!

31:10.118 --> 31:12.120
She betrayed me
and went back to the police.

31:17.542 --> 31:18.751
Sir, please wait.

31:26.467 --> 31:28.803
Ever since I saved her
from dying on the street,

31:28.887 --> 31:30.430
her life belonged to me.

31:31.973 --> 31:32.891
You need to stop this.

31:32.974 --> 31:33.850
I won't!

31:36.644 --> 31:38.021
I can't stop now.

31:39.689 --> 31:41.733
It's not something I can just stop now.

31:46.362 --> 31:48.656
It won't end until one of us is dead.

31:51.659 --> 31:52.660
Either I die…

31:55.580 --> 31:57.916
…or she dies.

32:01.294 --> 32:02.420
So, leave.

32:04.547 --> 32:05.673
Leave!

33:20.331 --> 33:21.374
Jiwoo.

33:23.251 --> 33:24.877
You have to be happy

33:25.920 --> 33:29.424
and live a good life
even if I'm not around, okay?

34:37.200 --> 34:38.785
Did you think I left?

34:40.495 --> 34:41.871
I got scared.

34:43.247 --> 34:44.707
"Don't be scared.

34:44.791 --> 34:46.292
We're cops, aren't we?"

34:55.384 --> 34:56.469
Let's go.

35:34.215 --> 35:35.466
Where to now, ma'am?

35:36.342 --> 35:37.927
Somewhere far away.

35:38.511 --> 35:40.304
Dongcheon is finished.

35:41.013 --> 35:42.223
Yes, ma'am.

36:13.880 --> 36:15.131
It'll be hard.

36:16.507 --> 36:18.759
The entire world will be against you.

36:19.802 --> 36:21.888
After the trial, you'll be put away.

36:26.642 --> 36:27.643
I know.

36:31.606 --> 36:32.773
I'm ready.

36:40.323 --> 36:42.074
Whatever you go through,

36:43.618 --> 36:45.119
I'll be with you.

38:08.327 --> 38:09.662
Hey!

38:09.745 --> 38:11.122
Pildo!

38:12.915 --> 38:14.458
- No!
- Jeon Pildo!

38:14.542 --> 38:15.543
Pildo!

38:15.626 --> 38:16.627
No!

38:18.254 --> 38:19.547
What happened?

39:02.465 --> 39:05.134
You will catch Choi Mujin.

39:40.419 --> 39:41.545
Open it.

40:56.662 --> 40:58.330
Where is that bitch?
We gotta find her.

40:58.414 --> 40:59.748
There she is.

40:59.832 --> 41:01.125
Whoa, whoa!

42:49.733 --> 42:50.693
Argh!

43:02.413 --> 43:03.414
Agh!

44:05.893 --> 44:07.186
You look tired.

44:08.479 --> 44:09.563
It's bearable.

44:11.607 --> 44:13.108
I can still kill you.

44:21.700 --> 44:23.744
Right. You should.

44:29.625 --> 44:31.251
Your father was a weak man.

44:33.462 --> 44:35.589
He had several chances to kill me,

44:36.632 --> 44:38.092
but he lacked courage.

44:41.553 --> 44:43.222
He was born to be prey.

44:53.232 --> 44:54.066
His hesitation…

44:55.234 --> 44:56.235
…made so that…

44:57.528 --> 44:58.570
you…

45:01.407 --> 45:04.576
me, and the policeman,
we've all been miserable.

45:11.375 --> 45:12.668
But you are different.

45:14.670 --> 45:16.171
You acted without fear.

45:20.259 --> 45:21.593
So why?

45:24.138 --> 45:26.265
Haven't you been waiting for this moment?

45:27.725 --> 45:28.809
So why?

45:30.686 --> 45:32.104
Why did you hesitate?

45:54.126 --> 45:55.502
That's right, I did.

45:59.339 --> 46:01.467
I wanted to live like a human.

46:09.099 --> 46:11.977
You asked if I wanted revenge
no matter what.

46:13.187 --> 46:15.522
I didn't know what you meant back then.

46:18.942 --> 46:20.110
I do now.

46:23.989 --> 46:26.241
To take revenge is to become a monster.

46:27.409 --> 46:29.578
A monster is what you are.

46:42.174 --> 46:43.342
That's right.

46:47.137 --> 46:48.639
You're a lot like me.

46:50.808 --> 46:52.184
Can you become…

46:55.354 --> 46:56.438
a monster?

47:00.192 --> 47:01.944
Because I hesitated,

47:04.488 --> 47:06.907
another person precious to me died.

47:11.495 --> 47:13.205
Someone who understood.

47:15.249 --> 47:17.793
He was somebody said I could rely on.

47:26.718 --> 47:27.970
I will become…

47:31.139 --> 47:32.391
…a monster.

47:36.687 --> 47:38.188
And I will take pleasure

47:38.272 --> 47:41.358
into watching you breathe
your very last breath.

48:12.306 --> 48:13.307
Argh!

48:16.101 --> 48:17.853
Can you kill me in the state you're in?

48:22.524 --> 48:23.650
Very good.

49:31.885 --> 49:32.970
Get up.

49:33.637 --> 49:35.472
That's right.

49:37.474 --> 49:38.892
Argh!

49:45.065 --> 49:46.566
Get up!

49:49.736 --> 49:50.988
Stab me!

49:56.368 --> 49:57.327
Again.

50:00.872 --> 50:02.124
That's right.

50:04.334 --> 50:05.502
Get up.

50:10.298 --> 50:12.592
It won't end until one of us dies.

51:02.350 --> 51:03.435
The temple.

51:05.437 --> 51:06.646
Upper lip.

51:09.024 --> 51:10.067
Chin.

51:11.359 --> 51:12.402
Chest.

51:14.529 --> 51:16.364
Do it.

51:19.242 --> 51:20.577
Stab me.

51:23.038 --> 51:24.289
Stab me!

51:27.292 --> 51:28.251
Come on!

51:39.262 --> 51:40.639
It's over for you.

51:45.185 --> 51:46.311
Accept it.

51:47.854 --> 51:51.191
You cannot… become a monster.

54:30.058 --> 54:33.937
DECEASED, KIM JEONGA

55:00.797 --> 55:03.925
TO DAD, FROM SONG JIWOO

55:08.138 --> 55:13.143
SONG JOONSU AND KIM JEONGA'S
FAMILY GRAVE

55:50.263 --> 55:56.227
JEON FAMILY GRAVE:
JEON PILDO, JEON DAEUN
